<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FreshStart Cleaning Co.</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>FreshStart Cleaning Co.</h1>
    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section id="home" class="hero">
    <h2>Professional Cleaning Services You Can Trust</h2>
    <p>Residential • Commercial • Move-In/Move-Out • Deep Cleaning</p>
    <button>Request a Free Quote</button>
</section>

<section id="services">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>

    <div class="service">
        <h3>🏠 House Cleaning</h3>
        <p>Weekly, bi-weekly, and monthly cleaning plans customized to your home.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service">
        <h3>🏢 Office Cleaning</h3>
        <p>Keep your workplace spotless with flexible scheduling.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service">
        <h3>✨ Deep Cleaning</h3>
        <p>Detailed top-to-bottom cleaning for every room.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service">
        <h3>📦 Move In / Move Out</h3>
        <p>Leave your old home sparkling or prepare your new one for move-in.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
    <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
    <p>
        FreshStart Cleaning Co. is dedicated to providing dependable,
        affordable, and high-quality cleaning services. Our trained
        professionals use eco-friendly products and pay attention to
        every detail.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Get Your Free Estimate</h2>
    <p>Email: info@freshstartcleaning.com</p>
    <p>Phone: (555) 123-4567</p>
    <button>Contact Us</button>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 FreshStart Cleaning Co. | Demo Website for Portfolio</p>
</footer>

<script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>